<title>POLAND: Prochnik revises down 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Prochnik revises down 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prochnik SA results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.45 vs    4.24</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.17 vs    1.87</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.14 vs    1.50</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Prochnik SA. Earlier company reported its net profit at 0.43 million zlotys. @</p>
<p>    net sales				 62.26 vs   58.63</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  48.24 vs   43.37</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   na   vs     na</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.03 vs    0.37</p>
<p>    other taxes				na   vs     na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.51 vs    0.35</p>
<p>    financial costs			  2.81 vs    2.73</p>
<p>    investment				 4.02 vs    2.01</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
